  orthogonal box = (21.200176 21.200176 21.200176) to (78.799824 78.799824 351.19602)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  17692 bonds
  reading angles ...
  34802 angles
  reading dihedrals ...
  50952 dihedrals
  reading impropers ...
  22624 impropers
